    "id": 531772,
    "title": "[IEEE Call for Papers] |3rd ICMACC-2026 Hyderabad, India|Nov-5-7,2026",
    "description": "<p data-start=\"127\" data-end=\"163\"><strong data-start=\"127\" data-end=\"146\">Dear Sir/Madam,</strong><br data-start=\"146\" data-end=\"149\"><strong data-start=\"149\" data-end=\"163\">Greetings!</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"165\" data-end=\"523\">Vallurupalli Nageswara Rao (VNR) Vignana Jyothi Institute of Engineering and Technology, Hyderabad, India, is organizing the <strong data-start=\"290\" data-end=\"421\">3rd International Conference on Recent Trends in Microelectronics, Automation, Computing and Communications Systems (ICMACC-26)</strong>, technically co-sponsored by <strong data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"477\">IEEE Hyderabad Section</strong>, to be held during <strong data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"522\">5th&ndash;7th November 2026</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"868\">ICMACC-26 aims to bring together academicians, researchers, and industry professionals to discuss recent advancements and research challenges in microelectronics, automation, computing, and communication systems. The conference will feature keynote talks, technical paper presentations, tutorials, panel discussions, and industry interactions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"987\">The conference is technically co-sponsored by IEEE Hyderabad Section and approved by IEEE (Conference ID: <strong data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"985\">69869</strong>).</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1012\"><strong data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1012\">Call for Papers</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1169\">Authors are invited to submit original and unpublished research papers using the IEEE format:<br data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1109\"><a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https://www.ieee.org/conferences/publishing/templates.html\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1167\">https://www.ieee.org/conferences/publishing/templates.html</a></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1451\"><strong data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1226\">Conference Tracks include (but are not limited to):</strong><br data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1229\">VLSI &amp; System Design, Robotics &amp; IoT, Communications &amp; Networking, Signal &amp; Image Processing, Computational Intelligence, Data Science, Power &amp; Energy Systems, Additive Manufacturing, and Emerging Education Technologies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1489\">Detailed tracks: <a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https://icmacc.org/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1489\">https://icmacc.org/</a></p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1515\"><strong data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1515\">Paper Submission</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1613\">Submission Portal: <a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https://cmt3.research.microsoft.com/ICMACC2026\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1581\">https://cmt3.research.microsoft.com/ICMACC2026</a><br data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1584\"><strong data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1597\">Deadline:</strong> 25th May 2026</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1765\">All accepted and presented papers will be submitted to <strong data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1703\">IEEE Xplore&reg; (Scopus Indexed)</strong>, subject to IEEE quality checks. Best papers will be awarded.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1850\"><strong data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1774\">PS:</strong> Kindly circulate this information among faculty, researchers, and students.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1965\">For queries, please contact:<br data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1883\"><strong data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1897\">P. Kishore</strong>, TPC Chair &ndash; ICMACC 2026<br data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1925\">📞 9866940403 | ✉ <a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1963\">icmacc2026@gmail.com</a></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"2025\"><strong data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"1988\">Thanks &amp; Regards,</strong><br data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"1991\"><strong data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"2023\">General Chairs &ndash; ICMACC 2026</strong></p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2159\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2098\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2029\" data-end=\"2098\"><strong data-start=\"2029\" data-end=\"2049\">B. Satyanarayana</strong>, DAE Raja Ramanna Chair (RRC), TIFR, Hyderabad</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2159\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2159\"><strong data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2130\">Dr. Yarlagadda Padma Sai</strong>, Professor, ECE, VNR VJIET</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-top: 0cm; mso-margin-bottom-alt: 8.0pt; mso-margin-top-alt: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-top: 0cm; mso-margin-bottom-alt: 8.0pt; mso-margin-top-alt: 0cm; mso-add-space: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://events.vtools.ieee.org/vtools_ui/media/display/430cef9e-f3b5-4dad-a37e-bfbfba1a99ac\" alt=\"\" width=\"931\" height=\"1317\"></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>",
